{0}{Hey! Don' give 'im anythin', 'ey? He's a bloody boozehound, he is.}{Hey! Don' give 'im anythin', 'ey? He's a bloody boozehound, he is.}{}{}{}{}
{1}{Oy! Pipe down in there! You're not goin' anywhere on my watch!}{Oy! Pipe down in there! You're not goin' anywhere on my watch!}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Forget it! Yer goin' nowhere! Ye shouldn't have been drinkin' in the public}{Forget it! Yer goin' nowhere! Ye shouldn't have been drinkin' in the public}{}{}{}{}
{3}{Aye, ye got that right, chum! Ye should probably go to an AA meetin' or somethin'.. An' get a job!}{Aye, ye got that right, chum! Ye should probably go to an AA meetin' or somethin'.. An' get a job!}{}{}{}{}
{4}{Don't give 'im anything! He'll just ask fer more!}{Don't give 'im anything! He'll just ask fer more!}{}{}{}{}
{5}{Aye, and ye'll keep gettin' locked up 'ere, mate, if ye keep it up.}{Aye, and ye'll keep gettin' locked up 'ere, mate, if ye keep it up.}{}{}{}{}
{6}{Because drunkards like ye are not supposed ta walk free in the city. At least not 'ere in Nodnol.}{Because drunkards like ye are not supposed ta walk free in the city. At least not 'ere in Nodnol.}{}{}{}{}
{7}{Use the damn bucket, I'm not cleaning your vomit again, mate!}{Use the damn bucket, I'm not cleaning your vomit again, mate!}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Ye oughta stop it some day, a nasty habit o'drinkin' ye got.}{Ye oughta stop it some day, a nasty habit o'drinkin' ye got.}{}{}{}{}
{9}{Yer disgusting, Skwerly. I should teach ye some proper manners, 'ey?}{Yer disgusting, Skwerly. I should teach ye some proper manners, 'ey? [He turns to you.] Don't mind 'im, miss. He's always like that. Damn drunkard..}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Hey! Pipe it down there! You're supposed ta be recovering, not jawin' with strangers!}{Hey! Pipe it down there, You're supposed ta be recovering, not jawin' with strangers!}{}{}{}{}
