{20}{Yer goin' nowhere until yer sober! Now pipe it down and get sum' sleep!}{Yer goin' nowhere until yer sober! Now pipe it down and get sum' sleep!}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Oh yeah? Well, it ain't right fer drunkards like ye to get drunk and dance around in yer underwear in the middle of the streets!}{Oh yeah? Well, it ain't right fer drunkards like ye to get drunk and dance around in yer underwear in the middle of the streets!}{}{}{}{}
{22}{No! Yer gettin' none! Forget it! Besides, we locked ye up here to get sober, not fer drinkin' more!}{No! Yer gettin' none! Forget it! Besides, we locked ye up here to get sober, not fer drinkin' more!}{}{}{}{}
{23}{Oh, aye? Well, I hate watchin' after yer sorry arse!}{Oh, aye? Well, I hate watchin' after yer sorry arse!}{}{}{}{}
{24}{If ye can't stand it, then why don't ye stop drinkin'? Yer havin' a serious drinkin' problem, ol' chap.}{If ye can't stand it, then why don't ye stop drinkin'? Yer havin' a serious drinkin' problem, ol' chap.}{}{}{}{}
{25}{Not bloody likely! Pipe it down already!}{Not bloody likely! Pipe it down already!}{}{}{}{}
{26}{I'm not buying that hogwash. Ye'll just start drinkin' again!}{I'm not buying that hogwash. Ye'll just start drinkin' again!}{}{}{}{}
{27}{Oy! It's not bloody christmas yet, and yer singin' is way off-key! It hurts me ears!}{Oy! It's not bloody christmas yet, and yer singin' is way off-key! It hurts me ears!}{}{}{}{}
{28}{Not a chance, boozehead!}{Not a chance, boozehead!}{}{}{}{}
{29}{But we do. It's the law, and it's against the law to drink in public. End of story.}{But we do. It's the law, and it's against the law to drink in public. End of story.}{}{}{}{}
{30}{Aye, that's the kinda talk I wanna be hearin'. Good for you, mate.}{Aye, that's the kinda talk I wanna be hearin'. Good for you, mate.}{}{}{}{}
